error[E0011]: `@container` opened with `{` at line 1 must be closed with `}`, not a `.end` tag
  --> mixed_brace_end.rin:3:1

 3 | .end/container
   | ^

reason:
  a block opened with `{` and one opened without it use different closers; mixing them is rejected so a block can never be closed by the wrong marker

help:
  replace the `.end/...` tag with `}`

